        "runId": "ada-en-20261109-fabedfca6889",
        "model": "ChatGPT"
      },
      "text": "This 12-day itinerary links the Caribbean Sea, Canaima National Park, Angel Falls, Caracas, La Paz and Bolivia’s high-altitude landscapes. The first part of the trip takes you to the Los Roques islands, Canaima Lagoon, a Pemón village and the Santa Teresa estate. In the second, you’ll visit La Paz, the Uyuni Salt Flat, Incahuasi Island, lagoons, geysers, the Salvador Dalí Desert and Licancabur Volcano."
